      #|  \226\136\128 clauses.\n        (?(<<). WF (<<) /\\\n                ALL (\\(s,t). tailadmissible(<<) (\\f a. T) s t) clauses) /\\\n        ALL (\\(s,t). \226\136\128 f x y. (s x = s y) ==> (t f x = t f y)) clauses /\\\n        PAIRWISE (\\(s,t) (s',t'). \226\136\128 f x y. (s x = s' y) ==> (t f x = t' f y))\n                 clauses\n        ==> (?f. ALL (\\(s,t). \226\136\128 x. f (s x) = t f x) clauses)
